  {"id": "sub3.example.org", "context_attributes": {"relationship_type": "subdomain_of", "confidence": 0.85}}
  // … up to 10 items
]
```

If you run the actual request with your key (`my_api`) and the parameters (`limit=10`, `continuation_cursor=abc`), you’ll get the real IDs and any context attributes that VirusTotal returns.

